error[NK2115]: `async` stands before a loop, but `async` is a prefix of an expression and no loop has a value.
  --> tests/async_parse_before_a_for_is_refused.nika:5:2
   |
 5 | 	async for i in [1, 2] {
   |  ^^^^^
   |
   = note: `async` starts only tasks whose number stands in the source.
   = help: To run the body for every element beside the others, write `xs.par_iter().for_each fn(x) { … }`.
